HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The cciissss driver first appeared in OpenBSD 3.8.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The cciissss driver was written by Michael Shalayeff <_m_i_c_k_e_y_@_o_p_e_n_b_s_d_._o_r_g>.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     For purposes of status monitoring, the current code only supports one
     logical volume per controller.

